{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24180","headline":"池上闲吟二首 二 · 白居易","name":"池上闲吟二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非庄非宅非兰若，竹树池亭十亩余。\n非道非僧非俗吏，褐裘乌帽闭门居。\n梦游信意宁殊蝶，心乐身闲便是鱼。\n虽未定知生与死，其间胜负两何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}